6,5290,5290.T,5290.T,5,ok,EQUITY,Vertex Corporation,Basic Materials,Building Materials,https://www.vertex-grp.co.jp,"Vertex Corporation manufactures and sells concrete secondary products in Japan. The company operates through the Concrete Business, Pile Business, Slope Disaster Prevention Project, and Others segments. Its Concrete Business segment engages in flood countermeasure and sewerage projects that offer disaster prevention and mitigation solutions, including water disaster countermeasures and seismic retrofitting of sewer facilities; road construction; railway business that offer hard concrete and special mortar; maintenance business; and housing and development business. This segment is also involved in the manufacture and sale of precast concrete products, such as manholes, concrete pipes, box culvert, and related products, as well as provision of installation work. The Pile Business segment engages in the manufacture and sale of centrifugal caprestressed concrete piles, as well as carrying out of pile driving work. Its Slope Disaster Prevention Project segment is involved in the manufacture and sale of disaster prevention products, such as rockfall and landslide protection fences, as well as sale and installation of related products. The Others segment engages in the manufacture and sale of ceramic and tunnel segment products, sale of hydraulic hoses, real estate rental, system development and sales, equipment rental and material sales, and RFID business. In addition, the company is involved in the concrete survey and testing business. Vertex Corporation was incorporated in 2018 and is headquartered in Chiyoda, Japan.",56964870144,JPY,,ok,https://www.vertex-grp.co.jp | https://www.vertex-grp.co.jp/ja/business.html | https://www.vertex-grp.co.jp/ja/news/news-2317647682034911331.html,"ホーム | 株式会社ベルテクスコーポレーション CLOSE MENU サブ-ナビゲーション -> ホーム ニュース VERTEXについて 事業内容 株主・投資家情報 サステナビリティ 会社情報 採用情報 お問い合わせ サイト利用規約 プライバシーポリシー NEWS お知らせ お知らせ NEWS 2026/09/02 内水氾濫対策に貢献するベルテクス