6,5310,5310.T,東洋炭素,3,ok,EQUITY,"Toyo Tanso Co., Ltd.",Industrials,Electrical Equipment & Parts,https://www.toyotanso.co.jp,"Toyo Tanso Co., Ltd. produces and sells carbon materials in Japan and internationally. The company provides isotropic graphite products for use in semiconductor, renewable energy, mold, and atomic power industries; carbon-carbon composite materials for use in electronics, environment and energy, general industrial furnaces, automobile industries, and other means of transport; and PERMA-FOIL, a flexible graphite sheet that is used as a seal to note automotive gaskets and packing. It also offers mechanical carbon products, such as bearings, seal rings for mechanical and joint seals, packing, vanes, valve seats, contact strips for pantograph, injection molding product, and sintered carbon graphite product; and carbon brush. In addition, the company provides CNovel, a porous carbon; EVEREDKOTE-C, a high-purity isotropic graphite substrate; PERMA KOTE, a SiC coated graphite for use in the semiconductor manufacturing industry; PYROGRAPH, pyrolytic graphite coating; GLASTIX KOTE, a graphite substrate impregnated or coated with glass-like carbon; Toyo siliconized graphite SiC/C composites; and KLASTA MATE, a metal/carbon composite. Further, it offers technical services, such as machining, heat treatment, high purity treatment, surface treatment, impregnation, forming, and measurement. The company was formerly known as Kondo Carbon Manufacturing Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Toyo Tanso Co., Ltd. in November 1949. The company was founded in 1941 and is based in Osaka, Japan.",145336958976,JPY,,ok,https://www.toyotanso.co.jp,"æ±æ´ç­ç´ æ ªå¼ä¼ç¤¾ TOYO TANSO Japan GlobalNetwork Global Site Americas United States English Mexico English Spanish Europe Italy Italian English France French English Germany German English Asiaã-ãPacific Japan Japanese English China Chinese Taiwan Chinese Korea Korean English Thailand Thai Japanese English Singapore En