6,5482,5482.T,5482.T,4,ok,EQUITY,Aichi Steel Corporation,Basic Materials,Steel,https://www.aichi-steel.co.jp,"Aichi Steel Corporation manufactures and sells steel materials, forged products, electronic functional materials and components, and magnetic products in Japan, the United States, Thailand, China, and internationally. It operates through Steel Company, Stainless Steel Company, Forge Company, Smart Company, and Others segments. The company offers specialty steel products, including carbon and alloy steel for machine structural use, H-shaped steel for structural use, alloy steel bolting materials for high temperature service, microalloyed and boron steel, and spring and high carbon chrome bearing steel; hot and cold work tool steel; stainless steel products, such as angle and unequal angle bars, channel and wide channel bars, flat and square bars, compression bars, welded H-beams and T-bars, round bars, stainless steel bars for concrete reinforcement, and custom welded shaped steel, as well as stainless steel products for high-pressure hydrogen, blades, building structures, and water sluices. It also provides titanium round, angle, and flat bars; forged products, including engine, chassis, transmission, driveline, and e-axle units; ultra-sensitive magnetic/MI sensors, MAGFIT dental magnetic attachments, and MAGFINE bonded magnets; amorphous wires; electronic materials and components, including lead frames, bonding pads, and heat spreaders; and TetsuRiki Agri/Aqua iron fertilizers for crops. In addition, the company is involved in the production of flame retardant materials and forging dies; design and installation of industrial furnaces; mining, processing, and sale of limestone and other minerals; cargo transportation, handling, and storage; software development; and sale and maintenance of computers and accessories. Further, it engages in the sale of daily commodities; and provision of restaurant, lunch catering, and gardening services, etc. Aichi Steel Corp