6,5609,5609.T,日鋳造,5,ok,EQUITY,Nippon Chuzo K. K.,Basic Materials,Steel,https://www.nipponchuzo.co.jp,"Nippon Chuzo K. K. engages in supplying large, special, and steel castings for construction in Japan. The company also provides steel materials, cast iron, new casting technologies and formed and fabricated materials, and particularly for casting maIt is also involved in Engineering services in relation to bearings and expansion joints; and Construction materials for NC base plates, and buildings and structures products. In addition, it provides space and defense, semiconductor and LCD production, construction machinery, energy systems, waste incineration, industrial presses, iron production, casting systems, mighty bar, hydraulic components. Further, the company provides pivot bearing, pivot roller bearing, pin bearing, pin roller bearing, pot bearing, spherical bearing, line bearing, horizontal bearing, rubber bearings, function-separated bearing, super high-damping rubber bearing, super high-damping rubber bearings for cold climates, horizontal force dispersing rubber bearing, disc rubber bearing, expansion joints, swivel joint, and maurer joint. Additionally, it offers damper units, such as Joining brackets, square to round joints, NC nodes, and joining pins; and construction hardware and landscaping products, including Joining brackets, square to round joints, NC nodes, joining pins, construction materials section, and NC base plate. The company was founded in 1920 and is headquartered in Kawasaki, Japan.",4406520832,JPY,,ok,https://www.nipponchuzo.co.jp | https://www.nipponchuzo.co.jp/company/ | https://www.nipponchuzo.co.jp/company/base/,日本鋳造株式会社 LANGUAGE - JAPANESE - ENGLISH - CHINESE ホーム 日本鋳造の強み コーナートップ 開発力 技術力 営業力 チーム力 企業情報 コーナートップ 代表挨拶 経営理念 社長方針 事業内容・生産拠点 経営体制 会社概要 SDGsへの貢献 購買基本方針 沿革 関係会社 コーポレート ガバナンス 年間カレンダー 事業・製品情報 コーナートップ 事業紹介 製品紹介 採用実績 カタログダウンロード 採用情報 コーナートップ 新卒採用 新卒採用トップ 会社情報 日本鋳造の仕事内容 募集要項 採用フロー エントリー キャリア採用 キャリア採用トップ 会社情報 募集職種一覧 募集要項 採用フロー エントリー ニュ