他にも圧延加工を施した鋼平線、めっきを施した亜鉛めっき鋼線・合金めっき鋼線・めっき鋼平線や着色塗装を施したカラー鋼線など数多くの製品を有し、様々な用途で幅広くご活用いただけます。 詳しく見る 鋲螺（ボルト）製品 鋲螺(ボルト)を製造・販売しております。当社の各種高力ボルトは建築物・橋梁・鉄塔などの接合部分に使われており、街づくりを、そして生活を支える大切な力として、社会に貢献しています。 詳しく見る TOP — 製品情報 Catalog カタログ閲覧はこちら Contact お問い合わせはこちら 〒660-0083 兵庫県尼崎市道意町6-74 TEL:06-6416-1021 FAX:06-6416-0254 日亜鋼業について トップメッセージ 会社概要 拠点情報 企業沿革 日亜メタバース ワイヤーワールド 製品情報 普通線材製品 三次加工製品 建材加工製品 特殊線材製品 鋲螺（ボルト）製品 技術情報 製造工程について めっきの特長 商品技術開発の歴史 品質取り組み 採用情報 お知らせ IR情報 サステナビリティ プライバシーポリシー © 2022 NICHIA STEEL WORKS."
6,5659,5659.T,日精線,4,ok,EQUITY,"Nippon Seisen Co.,Ltd.",Industrials,Tools & Accessories,https://www.n-seisen.co.jp,"Nippon Seisen Co.,Ltd. manufactures and sells stainless steel wires in Japan, Asia, North America, Europe, and internationally. It offers stainless-steel wires, such as spring, micro, cold heading, shaft, weaving, and high alloy/titanium wires for use in vehicles, aircraft, office automation appliances, electric appliances, medical instruments, commodities, and leisure goods, as well as screws, steel nettings, etc. The company also offers filament yarn, cloth, tape, belt, felt, knit, sleeve, chop, and other metal fibers under the NASLON brand name. In addition, it provides filters, such as metal filters, including NASLON filters, NPM filters, EXCEL PORE, FINE MET, and re-washable systems for synthetic fiber, film, resin, nuclear and thermal power generation, petroleum refining, medical, and other applications; and semiconductor gas filters for process and bulk gases, component protection, integrated gas panels, and diffusers. Further, the company offers palladium alloy roll-plated hydrogen separation membrane for high purity hydrogen gas production and purification; high-strength copper-alloy wire for optical pickup and camera module; stainless steel wire for high corrosion resistant and heat resistant springs; hydrogen embrittlement resistant stainless steel spring wire; duplex stainless-steel wire for corrosion resistant springs, ropes, fasteners, wire mesh, etc.; and co-based alloy for medical use. The company was formerly known as The Sanshin Special Wire Manufacturing Company and changed its name to Nippon Seisen Co.,Ltd. in October 1956. The company was incorporated in 1951 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan. Nippon Seisen Co.,Ltd. is a subsidiary of Daido Steel Co., Ltd.",43059372032,JPY,,ok,https://www.n-seisen.co.jp | https://www.n-seisen.co.jp/products/ | https://www.n-seisen.co.jp/development/product/,"日本精線株式会社 日本精線株式会社 ホーム 会社情報 製品案内 株主・投資家