6,5945,5945.T,5945.T,1,ok,EQUITY,"Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd.",Industrials,Tools & Accessories,https://www.tenryu-saw.com,"Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells saw blades in Japan and internationally. The company offers cutting tools, such as carbide tools for ferrous and non-ferrous metals, as well as wood applications; cutters and routers; HSS tools; and diamond saw blades, circular and band saw blades, circular knives, and miter saw blades. It also offers machines for carbide-tipped saw blades, including an ultrasonic bath for saw blades; and band saw processing machines comprising automatic band saw welders, levelers, heat-tensioning machines, hard-facing alloy tipping machines, hard-facing alloy rough grinders, side grinders, and saw sharpeners, as well as narrow band saw sharpeners. Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd. was founded in 1909 and is headquartered in Fukuroi, Japan.",20507482112,JPY,,ok,https://www.tenryu-saw.com | https://www.tenryu-saw.com/en/about/ | https://www.tenryu-saw.com/en/about/business/,"Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd. English Japanese ABOUT US ABOUT US Top Message Corporate Profile History Business Summary Office & Affiliations PRODUCTS PRODUCTS Cutting Tools Related Equipment Basics of carbide tipped saw blade TOP NEWS CONTACT US ABOUT US PRODUCTS To Japanese site News Show All Cutting is the origin of manufacturing Products Search for products by material and industry Ferrous Metals Non-Ferrous Metals Wood Plastics / Acrylics Ceramic, Cement-based material Paper Food Enviroment and Recycle Inquiry about a product About us 3711 Asaba, Fukuroi City, Shizuoka Pref., 437-1195 Japan TEL.+81-538-23-6111 FAX.+81-538-23-6584 TOP NEWS ABOUT US Top message Corporate Profile History Business Summary Office & Affiliations PRODUCTS Cutting Tools Carbide Tools For Ferrous Metals Carbide Tools For Non-Ferrous Metals Carbide Tools For Wood  series Carbide Tools For Wood  series Carbide Tools For Wood NEW  series Carbide Tools For Wood (Tooth Geometry A.B.C) Carbide Tools Others Diamond Tools HSS Tools Others Related Equipment Basics of carbide tipped saw blade CONTACT US Inquiry about a product Inquiry about R & D Inquiry about Investor Relations Other inquiries © Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved. About | Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd. English Japanese ABOUT US ABOUT US Top Message Corporate Profile History Business Summary Office & Affiliations PRODUCTS PRODUCTS Cutting Tools Related Equipment Basics of carbide tipped saw blade TOP NEWS CONTACT US ABOUT US PRODUCTS To Japanese site ABOUT US A history built on making premium quality Japanese-made saws. Our job is to develop products that accommodate new materials and advanced cutting conditions. Since the establishment of Tenryu in 1913, we have continued to make advancement as a pioneer in the industry, with the theme of ""cutting and processing"". We develop products that accommodate new materials and the ever-advancing needs of our customers, using the cutting edge manufacturing machinery and equipment that we have developed based on technologies accumulated over a long period of time. The 100-year history of Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd. is a history of endless challenges to cutting assignments. Top Message Corporate Profile History Business Summary Office & Affiliations 3711 Asaba, Fukuroi City, Shizuoka Pref., 437-1195 Japan TEL.+81-538-23-6111 FAX.+81-538-23-6584 TOP NEWS ABOUT US Top message Corporate Profile History Business Summary Office & Affiliations PRODUCTS Cutting Tools Carbide Tools For Ferrous Metals Carbide Tools For Non-Ferrous Metals Carbide Tools For Wood  series Carbide Tools For Wood  series Carbide Tools For Wood NEW  series Carbide Tools For Wood (Tooth Geometry A.B.C) Carbide Tools Others Diamond Tools HSS Tools Others Related Equipment Basics of carbide tipped saw blade CONTACT US Inquiry about a product Inquiry about R & D Inquiry about Investor Relations Other inquiries © Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved. Business Summary | About | Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd. English Japanese ABOUT US ABOUT US Top Message Corporate Profile History Business Summary Office & Affiliations PRODUCTS PRODUCTS Cutting Tools Related Equipment Basics of carbide tipped saw blade TOP NEWS CONTACT US ABOUT US PRODUCTS To Japanese site Business Summary Integration of advanced technologies in effort to achieve optimum cutting performance Since its establishment, Tenryu has continued its advancement as a manufacturer specializing in saw blades, carrying out consistent production, from the processing of materials, including the quenching of steel, to the completion of products. We keep a firm eye on changes in the material environments and integrate new development technologies and production technologies for the development of new products, which are embodied by our production department as valuable products. In addition to the production technologies that we have developed on our own, we also introduce the latest technologies as we keep up with the world situation, so as to respond to the needs of the users. Reliable products are the result of the continuous improvement of technologies and strict quality control systems. The ""PAS"" mark that is stamped on our products is a mark designed from a pair of calipers that were once used to manufacture saws accurately back in the days when Tenryu was established, and is a proof of the high accuracy and superior quality of the products. WORK FLOW Research & Development Product Development Based On Expert Know-how The demand for greater quality and precision in the field of cutting technology is being fueled by the growing diversity in types of materials being cut. Tenryu Saw Manufacturing's Research & Development Department has a team of specialized engineers who take charge of project themes related to product development and production technology, each leveraging their expertise in areas such as mechanical dynamics, electronic measurements, control technology, metal materials, heat treatment, and machining technology. We are committed to meeting our customers' needs. Manufacturing & Quality Control ""PAS"" Logo is Mark of High Quality Tenryu's production facilities feature world-class manufacturing equipment including a fully automatic heat treatment plant. Products bearing the PAS logo are not only manufactured with this equipment but are also subject to a rigorous regimen of quality control. The PAS logo stamped on all Tenryu products is a symbol of superior quality. Calipers, which were used to maintain manufacturing precision when Tenryu was first established, inspired the design of this logo. Today, it is the Tenryu trademark for quality, assuring customers that products stamped with the PAS logo have been manufactured from start to finish with the highest quality possible. Our slogan for the PAS logo is ""Quality is embedded in the manufacturing process."" Manufacturing Process The production of high-quality TENRYU products involve the steps shown below. Plate cutting Heat treatment Tempering Toothing Leveling and tensioning Plate surface grinding Brazing Sharpening TENRYU logo stamping Inspection Packaging Controlling 3711 Asaba, Fukuroi City, Shizuoka Pref., 437-1195 Japan TEL.+81-538-23-6111 FAX.+81-538-23-6584 TOP NEWS ABOUT US Top message Corporate Profile History Business Summary Office & Affiliations PRODUCTS Cutting Tools Carbide Tools For Ferrous Metals Carbide Tools For Non-Ferrous Metals Carbide Tools For Wood  series Carbide Tools For Wood  series Carbide Tools For Wood NEW  series Carbide Tools For Wood (Tooth Geometry A.B.C) Carbide Tools Others Diamond Tools HSS Tools Others Related Equipment Basics of carbide tipped saw blade CONTACT US Inquiry about a product Inquiry about R & D Inquiry about Investor Relations Other inquiries © Tenryu Saw Mfg. Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved."
6,5947,5947.T,5947.T,1,ok,EQUITY,Rinnai Corporation,Consumer Cyclical,"Furnishings, Fixtures & Appliances",https://www.rinnai.co.jp,"Rinnai Corporation manufactures and sells thermal equipment in Japan, the United States, Australia, China, South Korea, and Indonesia. The company offers water heaters, including hot-water units, bath hot-water units, hot-water and heating units, and gas/solar hybrid hot-water and heating systems; kitchen appliances, such as tabletop stoves, built-in-stoves, ovens, range food, dishwashers, and rice cookers; and air conditioning appliances comprising fan heaters, fan-forced heaters, and infrared heaters. It also provides commercial-use ceramics grills, gas stoves, and rice cookers; and clothes dryers, and infrared burners and parts. The company sells its products under the Rinnai brand. The company was formerly known as Rinnai & Co. and changed its name to Rinnai Corporation in 1971. Rinnai Corporation was incorporated in 1920 and is headquartered in Nagoya, Japan.",494565359616,JPY,,ok,https://www.rinnai.co.jp,リンナイ株式会社 企業情報サイト Skip to content 商品に関する大切なお知らせ お問い合わせ・サポート 言語 日本語 English 地域 グローバル 東アジア 韓国 上海 広州 台湾 香港 東南アジア ベトナム タイ シンガポール マレーシア インドネシア オセアニア オーストラリア ニュージーランド ヨーロッパ イギリス イタリア 北米 アメリカ カナダ 中南米 ブラジル メキシコ コスタリカ 企業情報 企業情報 トップ 基本情報 トップメッセージ リンナイについて 企業理念 ブランド 経営方針 人権方針 中期経営計画 事業内容 グローバル展開 モノづくり 会社紹介 会社概要 役員一覧 コーポレート・ガバナンス 事業所紹介 リンナイグループ 沿革 技術年表 受賞・表彰実績 会社案内動画・資料 資材調達 購買方針 グリーン調達 手続き 募集品目 登録（資材調達） 施工店募集 登録（施工店募集） ピックアップ ピックアップ 暮らしに関する調査 バドミントン日本代表 暮らしのコラム リンナイのラク家事 商品情報 総合商品情報サイト トップ キッチン バスルーム 給湯器 リビング トイレ・洗面・脱衣室 プロ用品 デジタルカタログ 取扱説明書 CM・動画集 ピックアップ ピックアップ 調理の新しい世界をあなたに デザインと機能が進化した、まったく新しいデラックスタイプが登場 無水調理鍋 Leggiero(レジェロ) フロントオープン食洗機 マイクロバブルバスユニット 色が選べるWeb限定ガスコンロ リンナイのラク家事 GOOD DESIGN テクノロジー テクノロジー トップ リンナイの技術 リンナイのテクノロジーと 価値創造のつながり カーボンニュートラルに 向けて（RIM 2050） 技術年表 研究開発 研究開発方針 研究開発体制 研究開発領域 Air Bubble Technology Leggiero 水素燃焼技術 プロダクトデザイン デザインフィロソフィー プロダクト事例 アワード 生産技術・モノづくり 生産技術方針 生産技術体制 コア生産技術 生産工場への展開 物流拠点への展開 モノづくり ピックアップ ピックアップ 暮らしに関する調