6,5983,5983.T,5983.T,2,ok,EQUITY,Iwabuchi Corporation,Industrials,Electrical Equipment & Parts,https://www.iwabuchi.co.jp,"Iwabuchi Corporation manufactures and sells electrical overhead wire hardware for electric power, communication, signals, broadcasting, and railway industries in Japan. The company offers power transmission and distribution equipment parts; communication equipment; broadcasting and supporting equipment; synthetic resin electrical insulation materials; and other electrical connection equipment. It also undertakes construction, electrical, telecommunication, designing, supervision, and facility contracting works. In addition, the company provides distribution line, CATV/information communication, traffic lights and road signs, school physical education facility, and disaster prevention radio services. Further, it offers seismic technology, contract testing, and renewable energy related services, as well as services for EV charging stations. Iwabuchi Corporation was founded in 1950 and is headquartered in Matsudo, Japan.",14154895360,JPY,,home_unavailable,https://www.iwabuchi.co.jp,
6,5984,5984.T,5984.T,1,ok,EQUITY,Kanefusa Corporation,Industrials,Specialty Industrial Machinery,https://www.kanefusa.co.jp,"Kanefusa Corporation engages in the manufacture and sale of industrial and machine knives, sawblades, tools, and machinery parts in Japan, Indonesia, The United States, Europe, China, Brazil, Vietnam, and internationally. The company offers saw blades, router and dowel bits, cutters, ace cutters and bits, finger joint cutters, cutter heads and knives, wood chipping products, and plywood knives for the wood based industry; and cold saw blades, ferrous and non-ferrous saw blades, non-ferrous cold saw blades, reamers and drills, face mill products, and other ferrous cutting tools for metal, aluminum, stainless steel, pipe sawing, and other applications. It also provides paper guillotine, trimmer, bookbinding, sheeter, and slitter knives for use in printing, book binding, and paper manufacturing applications; TCT saw blades, end mills, drills, and cutter heads for plastic applications; and PCD tools, such as saw blades, cutters, and router bits for ceramic and cement siding boards. In addition, it offers chipper and crusher knives for recycling industry, as well as hydraulic tool holders, centerless blades, and tool grinders for precision processes in machines. The company was founded in 1896 and is headquartered in Niwa, Japan.",10994835456,JPY,,ok,https://www.kanefusa.co.jp,兼房株式会社 ホーム 製品情報 CLOSE 製品情報TOP 木材（木質材料）加工 鉄鋼加工 アルミ加工 紙工業 樹脂加工 フィルム・シート・箔 窯業系材料加工 環境・リサイクル その他製品 カタログ・資料 ソリューション CLOSE ソリューションTOP 事例紹介 FAQ 技術サポート 展示会情報 会社情報 CLOSE 会社情報TOP トップメッセージ 会社概要 企業理念 事業内容 沿革 ネットワーク・拠点（国内） ネットワーク・拠点（海外） サステナビリティ CLOSE サステナビリティTOP サステナビリティ方針 優先的に取り組む課題 環境 社会 人財・知財 ガバナンス IR情報 CLOSE IR情報TOP IRライブラリー IRカレンダー 財務・業績サマリー 株式情報 電子公告 採用情報 Language EN 中文 Products 製品情報 木材（木質材料）加工 鉄鋼加工 アルミ加工 紙工業 樹脂加工 フィルム・シート・箔 製品情報をみる 兼房について Topics お知らせ メラミンボード切断用「SUPER BOARD PROⅢ TDM type」 紹介映像を公開しました。 展示会 JIMTOF2026に出展いたします。 新製品紹介 新製品 厚肉アルミビレット/プロファイル切断用「MAステイブルソー」 新製品紹介 フィニッシュカット用