6,6061,6061.T,6061.T,2,ok,EQUITY,"UNIVERSAL ENGEISHA Co., Ltd.",Consumer Cyclical,Home Improvement Retail,https://www.uni-green.co.jp,"UNIVERSAL ENGEISHA Co., Ltd. engages in the rental of plants and flowers in Japan. It rents plants for various venues, such as offices, hotels, restaurants, commercial spaces, showrooms, etc.; rents artificial flower arrangements; and provides landscape, gardening, and plant maintenance services. The company also offers greenery and flower gifts; artificial trees; greenery systems, such as rooftop gardening, planted wall murals, etc.; event decoration; flower arrangements; and garden flowerbeds and planters. In addition, it provides LED lights and illumination displays; rents photos and aquariums, as well as various cleaning products, such as entrance mats, mops, cleaning cloths, air cleaners, futon cleaning, etc.; and operates an online shop that offers various goods to corporate and individual assessors. Further, the company provides floral arrangements for wedding; and sells plants, flowers, containers, soils, fertilizers, gardening goods, fresh vegetables, breads, and other products, as well as pebbles, stones, and garden furniture products through garden centers. Additionally, it operates Ricoche+, a garden center for greeneries shopping; flower shop under the Fleur Universelle name; and garden-style café under the Les Grands Arbres brand name, which offers fresh meals. UNIVERSAL ENGEISHA Co., Ltd. was founded in 1968 and is headquartered in Ibaraki, Japan.",29518755840,JPY,,ok,https://www.uni-green.co.jp | https://www.uni-green.co.jp/references/ | https://www.uni-green.co.jp/references/references-rooftop-green/,"株式会社ユニバーサル園芸社 コンセプト 事業紹介 施工事例 会社情報 メディア情報 IR情報 採用情報 SDGsへの取組み 同業社の 皆様へ お問い合わせ JPN EN 日本語 ENGLISH コンセプト 事業紹介 事業紹介 トップ 空間プロデュース関連事業 レンタル／ディスプレイ シーズンディスプレイ ランドスケープ（造園） ルーフトップグリーン（屋上緑化事業） 生花 アーティフィシャルプランツ ウォールグリーン（壁面緑化事業） イベントディスプレイ イルミネーション エクステリア商材事業 木製小屋 ブランド事業 the Farm UNIVERSAL SOW the Farm UNIVERSAL Farmer’s Kitchen t