6,6138,6138.T,ダイジェト,2,ok,EQUITY,"Dijet Industrial Co., Ltd.",Industrials,Metal Fabrication,https://www.dijet.co.jp,"Dijet Industrial Co., Ltd. engages in the manufacture and sale of cemented carbide tools worldwide. The company provides drills, endmills, and other products, as well as indexable tools for high feed machining, shoulder milling, and finishing. It serves automotive, aerospace, and die and mold industries. The company was formerly known as Hyakunen Industrial Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Dijet Industrial Co., Ltd. in June 1954. Dijet Industrial Co., Ltd. was founded in 1938 and is headquartered in Osaka, Japan.",6058756096,JPY,,ok,https://www.dijet.co.jp,"﻿ ダイジェット工業株式会社 MENU CLOSE 製品紹介 企業紹介 採用情報 お問い合わせ IR INFORMATION IR情報 MORE 〒547-0002 大阪市平野区加美東２丁目１番１８号 TEL.06(6791)6781 代表 FAX.06(6793)1221 Copyright DIJET, Co., LTD. All Rights Reserved."
6,6140,6140.T,旭ダイヤ,2,ok,EQUITY,"Asahi Diamond Industrial Co., Ltd.",Industrials,Tools & Accessories,https://www.asahidia.co.jp,"Asahi Diamond Industrial Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells diamond tools in Japan, Taiwan, China, Europe, and North America. It offers grinding tools; precision cutting tools, including core drills for automotive glass drilling, diamond scribers, cutters with steel core, dicing blades, precision core drills, OD blades, electroplated band saws, and diamond wires; wear-resistant tools comprising injection molding nozzles, water jet nozzles, and wire guides; diamond dies for wire drawing; and dressers that include gear, sintered spiral, rectangular column diamond, diamond, natural diamond, synthetic single crystal diamond single-point, free cutting style diamond roller, and roller dressers, as well as roller dresser for profiling and electroformed roller dressers with sharpness-focused. The company also provides cutting tools, such as electroplated reamers, diamond coated tools, PCBN inserts, PCD/PCBN bites, PCD chip breaking tools, PCD drills, PCD/PCBN reamers, and monocrystalline diabetes/endmills, as well as PCD/PCBN endmills, routers, and tipped saws. In addition, it offers stone, construction, and mining tools, including mining and thin-wall bits, wire saws, blades, portable cut wheels, and portable cutters; and other tools, such as diamond files, drive units with AE sensors, sintered diamond/sintered CBN blanks, industrial diamond powders, industrial natural diamonds, and jewelries, as well as diamond pastes and diamond slurries and diluents. It serves electronics, semiconductors, transportation equipment, and other industries. Asahi Diamond Industrial Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1937 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",55833481216,JPY,,ok,https://www.asahidia.co.jp | https://www.asahidia.co.jp/corporate/ | https://www.asahidia.co.jp/corporate/outline/,"旭ダイヤモンド工業 Japanese English メルマガ登録 資料ダウンロード お問い合わせ ニュース 企業情報 企業情報 企業情報 企業情報 旭ダイヤにつ