6,6145,6145.T,6145.T,4,ok,EQUITY,"Nittoku Co.,Ltd.",Industrials,Specialty Industrial Machinery,https://www.nittoku.co.jp,"Nittoku Co.,Ltd. develops, manufactures, sells, and services automatic winding machines, and related machinery and parts in Japan and internationally. The company offers coil type products, including relay, solenoid, ignition, transformer, injector, pick up, reactor, PM stepping, sensor, IH coil, power inductor, speaker/receiver, chip inductor, and common mode; and motor core type products comprising solid core inner and outer winding, segmented core, open core, and armature. It also provides bobbin coil winding machines comprising air-core perfect layer, flyer type air core coil, square wire edgewise, IH coil winding machine, and speaker coil winding assembly line; chip winding machines, such as chip and power inductor, common mode, multi-axis common mode coil winding machine, and inspection machine; and motor related machines. In addition, the company provides wire/cable manufacturing equipment, such as unwinding/winding machine, stranded wire winding machine, shield horizontal winding machine, taping equipment, and cable processing equipment; processing machines; and connector related equipment, such as terminal insertion and bending machine, and bending straightener. Further, it offers film/web transfer equipment, including high-speed intermittent film transfer machine, continuous film transfer, and multi capacitor winding machine; medical related automatic machine comprising stranded wire, catheter and guide wire winding, and laser stripping machine; other automated machinery, such as vehicle camera lens assembly machine, wire harness terminal automatic processing machine, and vehicle battery transfer equipment; and IC cards. The company was formerly known as Nittoku Engineering Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Nittoku Co.,Ltd. in August 2019. Nittoku Co.,Ltd. was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Saitama, Japan.",41038741504,JPY,,ok,