6,6146,6146.T,ディスコ,3,ok,EQUITY,Disco Corporation,Technology,Semiconductor Equipment & Materials,https://www.disco.co.jp,"Disco Corporation manufactures and sells precision cutting, grinding, and polishing machines in Japan and internationally. The company offers precision machines include dicing saws, laser saws, grinders, polishers, wafer mounters, die separators, inspection systems, surface planers, and waterjet saws. It also provides precision processing tools, such as dicing blades, grinding wheels, and dry polishing wheels; and other products, such as accessory equipment, cut-off wheels, and related products. In addition, the company is involved in the maintenance, disassembly, and recycling of precision cutting, grinding, and polishing machines, as well as provides training services for the maintenance and operation of its machines. Further, it leases precision machines; and purchases and sells used machines. Additionally, the company manufactures and sells precision diamond abrasive tools; and offers chargeable processing services. Disco Corporation was founded in 1937 and is based in Ota, Japan.",5907152371712,JPY,,ok,https://www.disco.co.jp,共通 | 株式会社ディスコ
6,6147,6147.T,ヤマザキ,6,ok,EQUITY,"Yamazaki Co., Ltd.",Industrials,Specialty Industrial Machinery,https://www.yamazaki-iron.co.jp,"Yamazaki Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells various machine tools in Japan and internationally. It operates through two segments: Transportation Equipment Business and Machine Tool Business segments. The Transportation Equipment Business segment engages in the manufacture, processing and sale of transmission and control parts for motorcycles. The Machine Tool Business segment engages in the sale of indexing machines and other specialized machine tools, as well as boring machines. The company provides machine cell type dedicated machine; transfer machine; machine tool preventive maintenance systems; and other machines. It also offers labor saving equipment, including engine assembly and assembly equipment; transfer/conveyance automation equipment; pre-processing equipment; and image inspection devices. In addition, the company offers CAD data and YMT turret heads; TWB type index tables; WB type double wedge rings; and BHX spindle heads, YSBE type feed units, horizontal machining centers, and cross feed units. Further, the company engages in the production of motorcycle, automobiles, semiconductor manufacturing equipment, and environmental equipment parts; transportation equipment parts; and tool holder tensile force measuring instrument, such as pull meter and micro bubble. Yamazaki Co., Ltd. was founded in 1946 and is headquartered in Hamamatsu, Japan.",847496064,JPY,,ok,https://www.yamazaki-iron.co.jp | https://www.yamazaki-iron.co.jp/company/ | https://www.yamazaki-iron.co.jp/business/,"株式会社ヤマザキ 企業情報 事業案内 サービス・サポート IR情報 採用情報 お問い合わせ 製造未踏の地へ、 旅の始まり。 お知らせ NEWS お知らせ一覧 2026.8.7 IR PDF 2027年3月期 第1四半期決算短信を掲載しました。 2026.8.7 IR PDF 「特別利益（固定資産売却益）の発生に関するお知らせ」を掲載しました。 2026.6.26 IR PDF 2026年3月期有価証券報告書を掲載しました。 2026.6.26 IR PDF 2026年3月期（第66期）株主通信を掲載しました。 2026.6.8 IR PDF 「資本金の額の減少及び剰余金の処分に関するお知らせ」の一部訂正に関するお知らせ 企業情報 Company 事業案内 Products サービス・サポート Service S