6,6171,6171.T,6171.T,3,ok,EQUITY,C.E.Management Integrated Laboratory Co.Ltd,Industrials,Engineering & Construction,https://www.dksiken.co.jp,"C.E.Management Integrated Laboratory Co.Ltd provides services in the areas of civil engineering and construction in Japan. The company conducts geological surveys to obtain ground information for the construction for civil engineering structures and buildings; surveys and diagnosis of various infrastructures; disaster prevention systems, including the installation of debris flow warning systems, automatic monitoring systems, and measurement equipment to ensure safety of construction sites; and soil investigation services, such as conducting of surveys and tests in various situations comprising quality control, form control, and data provision. It also conducts surveys and tests on the natural environment, which comprise soil against environmental pollution; and non-destructive testing services, including investigation and diagnosis of social infrastructures, such as roads, railways, ports, airports, water, gas, and electricity, as well as buildings and condominiums. In addition, the company offers survey and design services comprising slope stability analysis consulting, pollution diffusion analysis, and construction drawing creation services; and undertakes soil remediation and ground reinforcement works. C.E.Management Integrated Laboratory Co.Ltd was incorporated in 1985 and is headquartered in Chikuma, Japan.",5304235008,JPY,,ok,https://www.dksiken.co.jp | https://www.dksiken.co.jp/company/ | https://www.dksiken.co.jp/company/outline/,"株式会社 土木管理総合試験所 | 卓越した調査技術で、社会インフラと人々の 暮らしの安心・安全を守ります コンテンツへスキップ ナビゲーションに移動 卓越した調査技術で、社会インフラと人々の 暮らしの安心・安全を守ります お問い合わせ 企業情報 代表挨拶 企業理念・経営方針 会社概要 拠点一覧・アクセス グループ・関連会社 有資格者 沿革 事業情報 事業について 主な業務 対応試験リスト よくある質問 協力業者募集 フランチャイズ 加盟FC店 一覧 DKFCの方針 FCシステムについて 新規FC店募集説明会 株主・投資家 投資家の皆様へ IRニュース IRライブラリー コーポレートガバナンス 株主メモ よくある質問 サステナビリティ マテリアリティ（重要課題） SDGsの取り組み CSR活動 自然資本に関する取り組み アスリート社員 採用 社会インフラと 人々の暮らしを守りま